  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder and transformer aggregation (config_006) achieve the highest accuracy (0.6530). The next experiment should test whether combining this effective RNA encoder with a more powerful image encoder (ViT) and a different fusion method (weighted) can improve performance. This isolates the impact of image data quality and fusion strategy, which remain uncertain despite previous multimodal attempts (config_030). The experiment balances exploration of image modality with leveraging established RNA encoder strengths, addressing key design choices without overcomplicating the setup."
